      "start_seconds": 1.15,
      "end_seconds": 5.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. I've settled them in, ready when you are."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.45,
      "end_seconds": 10.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "Perfect, thanks. Hello there, so what's the trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.84,
      "end_seconds": 20.07,
      "duration_seconds": 8.23,
      "text": "Honestly, um, it's a late period, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.9,
      "end_seconds": 24.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.6,
      "end_seconds": 28.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Oh, it's been three days now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.41,
      "end_seconds": 33.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Have you noticed anything else alongside it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.62,
      "end_seconds": 54.4,
      "duration_seconds": 19.78,
      "text": "when it it starts I tend to get light brown spotting as well well, I've been feeling slightly dizzy too, for two months yeah, you know, the light brown spotting? That's been for one week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 55.67,
      "end_seconds": 67.59,
      "duration_seconds": 11.92,
      "text": "Doctor I've got the readings for you. SpO2 98 percent on room air temperature is 36.7 degrees blood pressure 121 over 75 respiratory rate 16 heart rate 78."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.73,
      "end_seconds": 69.63,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "okay, noted"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.25,
      "end_seconds": 74.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.32,
      "end_seconds": 84.02,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.97,
      "end_seconds": 87.28,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.56,
      "end_seconds": 105.17,
      "duration_seconds": 6.61,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft with mild tenderness low on the left and the pregnancy test is positive."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.7,
      "end_seconds": 113.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "that's the the examination finished any sign of shoulder tip pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.82,
      "end_seconds": 117.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Definitely no shoulder tip pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.73,
      "end_seconds": 121.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Any collapse, severe pain or heavy bleeding?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.91,
      "end_seconds": 127.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "um, no, none that that I've noticed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.12,
      "end_seconds": 131.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "right right any muscle or joint problems besides this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.75,
      "end_seconds": 135.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "Nothing else aches."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.86,
      "end_seconds": 141.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.03,
      "end_seconds": 144.0,
      "duration_seconds": 0.97,
      "text": "breathing's normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.44,
      "end_seconds": 148.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "let me ask about allergies anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.07,
      "end_seconds": 154.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "No uh not that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.99,
      "end_seconds": 174.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.97,
      "end_seconds": 183.59,
      "duration_seconds": 7.62,
      "text": "Uh, yes, I had a wisdom tooth extraction under sedation, five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.23,
      "end_seconds": 188.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 190.22,
      "end_seconds": 194.58,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "um, uh, I've had eczema, yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.83,
      "end_seconds": 206.29,
      "duration_seconds": 10.46,
      "text": "Right so eczema is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 207.51,
      "end_seconds": 209.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "My brother has epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.27,
      "end_seconds": 212.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "right are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.92,
      "end_seconds": 216.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.44,
      "end_seconds": 221.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "so, tell me about your eating"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.46,
      "end_seconds": 228.03,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.9,
      "end_seconds": 231.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.04,
      "end_seconds": 237.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.91,
      "end_seconds": 261.24,
      "duration_seconds": 7.33,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines? I'll explain everything as we go along."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.93,
      "end_seconds": 275.04,
      "duration_seconds": 13.11,
      "text": "erm, uh, I take hydrocortisone cream, when needed for the eczema i do miss it now and then, uh, to be fair"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.09,
      "end_seconds": 288.37,
      "duration_seconds": 12.28,
      "text": "Let me tell you where I've got to. I'm honestly not certain yet. It could be a pregnancy of unknown location, ectopic not excluded, or it might be a threatened miscarriage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 289.71,
      "end_seconds": 292.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "right, is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.92,
      "end_seconds": 326.65,
      "duration_seconds": 29.73,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a pregnancy of unknown location, ectopic not excluded, but I'd like to confirm. I'll request an early pregnancy scan, it'll help with pregnancy of unknown location. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. Even with little pain this needs a scan within a day, and go to hospital if the pain gets worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.73,
      "end_seconds": 335.29,
      "duration_seconds": 6.56,
      "text": "I'd like you to see the early pregnancy unit as well, and I'll write the referral."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 336.56,
      "end_seconds": 337.26,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "okay"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 339.22,
      "end_seconds": 344.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.88,
      "text": "is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 345.17,
      "end_seconds": 352.98,
      "duration_seconds": 7.81,
      "text": "sorry, um, what was I saying, good, thanks, I'll see you then"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.06,
      "end_seconds": 359.87,
